The book's function name say_As-Salaam-Alaikum is not valid Python: a name may contain only letters, digits and underscores, and the hyphens make Python stop with a SyntaxError. Working code uses a valid name such as say_salaam:
# greetings.py
def say_salaam():
....return "As-Salaam-Alaikum, everyone!"

# main.py
import greetings
def main():
....message = greetings.say_salaam()
....print(message)
if __name__ == "__main__": main()
